  ('20472155-2ab7-51d8-8066-9269278b9245', 'AI Academy (Self-paced)', 'Learn how computers and artificial intelligence work, at your own pace. You will explore how computers process information, AI history and common AI tools, problem-solving with Scratch and Python, data and prediction, and AI ethics, then design an AI idea for your community. Goals: explain how computers and AI systems work, build confidence through hands-on projects, practice critical thinking, and weigh AI''s benefits, risks and limits. For grades 6-12. No experience needed.', 'beginner', 'self_paced', true, null, true)
