   '{"markdown":"## Welcome to AI Academy\n\nWelcome! In AI Academy you will learn how computers work and what artificial intelligence (AI) really is.\nYou do not need any experience. You just need to be curious.\n\n### What will we learn?\n\n1. Computers and how they process information\n2. AI history and common AI technologies\n3. Problem-solving with Scratch and Python\n4. Data, patterns, and prediction\n5. Ethics, sustainability, and social good\n6. A community-focused AI project (capstone)\n\n### Course goals\n\nBy the end, you will be able to:\n\n- Explain how computers and AI systems work\n- Build confidence through hands-on projects\n- Practice critical thinking and problem-solving\n- Judge AI''s benefits, risks, and limits\n- Design and present an AI idea for a real need in your community\n\n### How we learn together\n\n- Be curious - questions are always welcome.\n- Try before saying, \"I can''t.\"\n- Help others without taking over.\n- Critique ideas, not people.\n- Use AI honestly and protect personal information.\n- Make something you are proud to share.","title":"Welcome to AI Academy"}'::jsonb)
